==Description==
{{Description|This enemy has a {{Color|help|higher RES|nobold=1}} to {{Color|[[Electro]] DMG|nobold=1}}.<br /><br />The Spacetrek Explorer has sturdy armor and exceptional mobility. It is equipped with an electromagnetic gun and has a shield generator that can extend protection to allies.<br /><br />Hitting Spacetrek Explorer with Tune Break disables its shield generator, removing its active Shield and preventing new ones from generating.<br /><br />In the face of the vast unknown lands in Lahai-Roi, the Spacetrek Collective developed the multi-purpose Spacetrek Explorer to serve in transport, storage, and defense roles. Its wheeled legs and heavy-duty tires allow it to race along vertical surfaces, making it suitable for both urban and off-road terrain. The onboard storage compartments are designed to support long-term scientific expeditions.|Description when discovered}}

